<title>DENMARK: Danish Kommunekredit raises amount on 4.0% bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Kommunekredit raises amount on 4.0% bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Kommunekredit on Friday raised an existing 1.035.2 billion crown, four percent, six year bond offer to 1.148.825 billion crowns, lead manager Gudme Raaschou Bankaktieselskab said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The bond matures in 2002 and the issue has been sold, it said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
